# @middag-io/react is published to the PUBLIC npm registry. Pin the scope here so
# the boilerplate installs with a plain `npm install` on any machine — including
# ones whose global ~/.npmrc points @middag-io at GitHub Packages — and so CI
# resolves it without a credential (the whole point of an externally installable
# OSS reference). Without this, npm ci follows lockfile URLs baked against
# npm.pkg.github.com and fails 401.
@middag-io:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
